    1 print potentials, 0 - yes, 1 - no
    3 JTEST, debug flag
    0 reaction format, 0 - just names, 1 - sat. phases 2 -  S and V, 3 - stoichiometry, 4 - everything
    0 console messages, 0 - yes, 1 - suppress most
    1 short print file, 0 - yes, 1 - no
    1 for gridded minimization grid refinement, 1 - true boundaries, 2 - all boundaries
   40 for gridded minimization JLOW, number of y-nodes at lowest level
