    0 number component transformations
   12 number of components
    1 component amounts, 0 - molar, 1 weight
    1 assemblage data 0 - print, 1 - suppress
    0 variance flag, 0 - calculate all, 1 - only true univariants
    1 IDBASE data base code
    5 ifug EoS for saturated phase
